  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The character can channel ki to heal herself of physical abuse and damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Con 13, Wis 13.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> To use this feat, you must expend your ki focus. Each point of ki expended heals 3 hit points, up to your current maximum hit points.</p>\n<p>You gain one point of ki.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/jade-feats#toc21\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
